{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026eYZe1y2eay1795270351.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一名72歲婆婆，在北角過馬路時，被私家車撞倒受傷，清醒送院治理。司機涉嫌危險駕駛被捕。</p><p></p><p>意外後地上遺下牛仔褲布，染有血跡，多名警員到場調查，用尺量度和搜證。事發在下午3時許，一名72歲婆婆在福蔭道與宏安道交界過路時，被一輛私家車撞倒受傷，清醒送往東區醫院治理。警方以涉嫌危險駕駛引致他人身體受嚴重傷害，拘捕50歲私家車男司機。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T14:25:46.495199+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T13:37:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T14:57:26.692395+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T14:17:21.697426+00:00","content_hash":"165429994dabebd3949525f5b85cd152ff01799a9101d2ad26315123ae585dd9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T14:25:46.495199+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}